  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 3296686080
    m_Localized: Constellation Connect
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3711922176
    m_Localized: Scripture quotations taken from the World English Bible (WEB), Public
      Domain.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310784
    m_Localized: Faith & Strength
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310785
    m_Localized: Philippians 4:13
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310786
    m_Localized: I can do all things through Christ, who strengthens me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310787
    m_Localized: I can do all things
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310788
    m_Localized: through Christ,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310789
    m_Localized: who strengthens me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310790
    m_Localized: Joshua 1:9
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310791
    m_Localized: Haven't I commanded you? Be strong and courageous. Don't be afraid.
      Don't be dismayed, for Yahweh your God is with you wherever you go.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310792
    m_Localized: Be strong and courageous.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310793
    m_Localized: Don't be afraid. Don't be dismayed,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310794
    m_Localized: for Yahweh your God is with you
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310795
    m_Localized: wherever you go.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310796
    m_Localized: Isaiah 40:31
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310797
    m_Localized: But those who wait for Yahweh will renew their strength. They will
      mount up with wings like eagles.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310798
    m_Localized: But those who wait for Yahweh
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310799
    m_Localized: will renew their strength.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310800
    m_Localized: They will mount up with wings like eagles.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310801
    m_Localized: Psalm 27:1
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310802
    m_Localized: Yahweh is my light and my salvation. Whom shall I fear? Yahweh is
      the strength of my life. Of whom shall I be afraid?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310803
    m_Localized: Yahweh is my light and my salvation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310804
    m_Localized: Whom shall I fear?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310805
    m_Localized: Yahweh is the strength of my life.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310806
    m_Localized: 2 Timothy 1:7
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310807
    m_Localized: For God didn't give us a spirit of fear, but of power, love, and
      self-control.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310808
    m_Localized: For God didn't give us a spirit of fear,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310809
    m_Localized: but of power, love,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310810
    m_Localized: and self-control.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310811
    m_Localized: Psalm 46:1
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310812
    m_Localized: God is our refuge and strength, a very present help in trouble.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310813
    m_Localized: God is our refuge
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310814
    m_Localized: and strength,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310815
    m_Localized: a very present help in trouble.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310816
    m_Localized: Peace & Comfort
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310817
    m_Localized: Psalm 23:1-2
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310818
    m_Localized: Yahweh is my shepherd; I shall lack nothing. He makes me lie down
      in green pastures.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310819
    m_Localized: Yahweh is my shepherd;
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310820
    m_Localized: I shall lack nothing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310821
    m_Localized: He makes me lie down in green pastures.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310822
    m_Localized: John 14:27
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310823
    m_Localized: Peace I leave with you. My peace I give to you; not as the world
      gives, I give to you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310824
    m_Localized: Peace I leave with you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310825
    m_Localized: My peace I give to you;
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310826
    m_Localized: not as the world gives, I give to you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310827
    m_Localized: Matthew 11:28
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310828
    m_Localized: Come to me, all you who labor and are heavily burdened, and I will
      give you rest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310829
    m_Localized: Come to me,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310830
    m_Localized: all you who labor and are heavily burdened,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310831
    m_Localized: and I will give you rest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310832
    m_Localized: Philippians 4:7
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310833
    m_Localized: And the peace of God, which surpasses all understanding, will guard
      your hearts and your thoughts in Christ Jesus.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310834
    m_Localized: And the peace of God,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310835
    m_Localized: which surpasses all understanding,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310836
    m_Localized: will guard your hearts and your thoughts in Christ Jesus.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310837
    m_Localized: Isaiah 26:3
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310838
    m_Localized: You will keep whoever's mind is steadfast in perfect peace, because
      he trusts in you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310839
    m_Localized: You will keep whoever's mind is steadfast
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310840
    m_Localized: in perfect peace,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310841
    m_Localized: because he trusts in you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310842
    m_Localized: 1 Peter 5:7
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310843
    m_Localized: Casting all your worries on him, because he cares for you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310844
    m_Localized: Casting all your worries
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310845
    m_Localized: on him,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310846
    m_Localized: because he cares for you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310847
    m_Localized: God's Unfailing Love
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310848
    m_Localized: John 3:16
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310849
    m_Localized: For God so loved the world, that he gave his only born Son, that
      whoever believes in him should not perish, but have eternal life.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310850
    m_Localized: For God so loved
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310851
    m_Localized: the world,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310852
    m_Localized: that he gave his only born Son,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310853
    m_Localized: that whoever believes in him should not perish, but have eternal
      life.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310854
    m_Localized: Romans 8:38-39
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310855
    m_Localized: For I am persuaded that neither death, nor life, nor angels, nor
      principalities, will be able to separate us from God's love.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310856
    m_Localized: For I am persuaded that neither death, nor life,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310857
    m_Localized: will be able to separate us
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310858
    m_Localized: from God's love.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310859
    m_Localized: 1 John 4:19
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310860
    m_Localized: We love him, because he first loved us.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310861
    m_Localized: We love him,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310862
    m_Localized: because he
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310863
    m_Localized: first loved us.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310864
    m_Localized: 1 Corinthians 13:4
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310865
    m_Localized: Love is patient and is kind. Love doesn't envy. Love doesn't brag,
      is not proud.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310866
    m_Localized: Love is patient and is kind.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310867
    m_Localized: Love doesn't envy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310868
    m_Localized: Love doesn't brag, is not proud.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310869
    m_Localized: Romans 5:8
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310870
    m_Localized: But God commends his own love toward us, in that while we were yet
      sinners, Christ died for us.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310871
    m_Localized: But God commends his own love toward us,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310872
    m_Localized: in that while we were yet sinners,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310873
    m_Localized: Christ died for us.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310874
    m_Localized: 1 John 3:1
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310875
    m_Localized: See how great a love the Father has given to us, that we should
      be called children of God!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310876
    m_Localized: See how great a love
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310877
    m_Localized: the Father has given to us,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310878
    m_Localized: that we should be called children of God!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310879
    m_Localized: Wisdom & Guidance
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310880
    m_Localized: Proverbs 3:5-6
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310881
    m_Localized: Trust in Yahweh with all your heart, and don't lean on your own
      understanding. In all your ways acknowledge him, and he will make your paths
      straight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310882
    m_Localized: Trust in Yahweh with all your heart,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310883
    m_Localized: and don't lean on your own understanding.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310884
    m_Localized: In all your ways acknowledge him,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310885
    m_Localized: and he will make your paths straight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310886
    m_Localized: Psalm 119:105
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310887
    m_Localized: Your word is a lamp to my feet, and a light for my path.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310888
    m_Localized: Your word
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310889
    m_Localized: is a lamp to my feet,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310890
    m_Localized: and a light for my path.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310891
    m_Localized: James 1:5
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310892
    m_Localized: But if any of you lacks wisdom, let him ask of God, who gives to
      all liberally and without reproach, and it will be given to him.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310893
    m_Localized: But if any of you lacks wisdom,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310894
    m_Localized: let him ask of God,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310895
    m_Localized: who gives to all liberally and it will be given to him.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310896
    m_Localized: Psalm 32:8
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310897
    m_Localized: I will instruct you and teach you in the way which you shall go.
      I will counsel you with my eye on you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310898
    m_Localized: I will instruct you and teach you
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310899
    m_Localized: in the way which you shall go.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310900
    m_Localized: I will counsel you with my eye on you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310901
    m_Localized: Matthew 5:16
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310902
    m_Localized: Even so, let your light shine before men, that they may see your
      good works and glorify your Father who is in heaven.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310903
    m_Localized: Even so, let your light shine before men,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310904
    m_Localized: that they may see your good works
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310905
    m_Localized: and glorify your Father who is in heaven.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310906
    m_Localized: Colossians 3:16
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310907
    m_Localized: Let the word of Christ dwell in you richly; in all wisdom teaching
      and admonishing one another.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310908
    m_Localized: Let the word of Christ
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310909
    m_Localized: dwell in you richly;
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310910
    m_Localized: in all wisdom teaching one another.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310911
    m_Localized: Hope & Purpose
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310912
    m_Localized: Jeremiah 29:11
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310913
    m_Localized: For I know the thoughts that I think toward you, says Yahweh, thoughts
      of peace, and not of evil, to give you hope and a future.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310914
    m_Localized: For I know the thoughts that I think toward you,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310915
    m_Localized: thoughts of peace, and not of evil,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310916
    m_Localized: to give you hope and a future.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310917
    m_Localized: Romans 8:28
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310918
    m_Localized: We know that all things work together for good for those who love
      God, for those who are called according to his purpose.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310919
    m_Localized: We know that all things
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310920
    m_Localized: work together for good
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310921
    m_Localized: for those who are called according to his purpose.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310922
    m_Localized: Romans 15:13
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310923
    m_Localized: Now may the God of hope fill you with all joy and peace in believing,
      that you may abound in hope.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310924
    m_Localized: Now may the God of hope
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310925
    m_Localized: fill you with all joy and peace in believing,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310926
    m_Localized: that you may abound in hope.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310927
    m_Localized: Hebrews 11:1
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310928
    m_Localized: Now faith is assurance of things hoped for, proof of things not
      seen.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310929
    m_Localized: Now faith is assurance
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310930
    m_Localized: of things hoped for,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310931
    m_Localized: proof of things not seen.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310932
    m_Localized: Ephesians 2:10
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310933
    m_Localized: For we are his workmanship, created in Christ Jesus for good works,
      which God prepared before that we would walk in them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310934
    m_Localized: For we are his workmanship,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310935
    m_Localized: created in Christ Jesus for good works,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310936
    m_Localized: which God prepared before that we would walk in them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310937
    m_Localized: Lamentations 3:22-23
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310938
    m_Localized: It is because of Yahweh's loving kindnesses that we are not consumed,
      because his mercies don't fail. They are new every morning.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310939
    m_Localized: It is because of Yahweh's loving kindnesses
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310940
    m_Localized: that we are not consumed, because his mercies don't fail.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3720310941
    m_Localized: They are new every morning.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
